        "name": "Shimotsuki (Basic Attack)",
        "description": "With at least 2 points of /bFallen Frost//b, hold [BASIC] to activate:\n\nHoshimi Miyabi sheaths her blade, enters /bShimotsuki Stance//b and starts to charge up. Every level of charge will consume 2 points of /bFallen Frost//b, up to a maximum of three levels of charge. When releasing [BASIC], or when /bFallen Frost//b is completely depleted, Hoshimi Miyabi will draw her blade and unleash a powerful slash ahead based on the current charge level, dealing massive Frost DMG. She then exits /bShimotsuki Stance//b.\n\nCharacter is invulnerable during /bShimotsuki Stance//b. Hoshimi Miyabi can have up to 6 points of /bFallen Frost//b. Upon entering the battlefield, Hoshimi Miyabi immediately obtains 3 points of /bFallen Frost//b.",
